iness_count":2},{"category":"Venues & Event Spaces","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Hotels & Travel","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Lounges","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rrNF0siUBVQOOgsFVfGpKA","review_id":"yU9qeQBn2G7NdS_4r9c2jA","date":"2011-05-03T19:33:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398669600486755,"text_excerpt":"This was possible one of my favorite hotel bars in New Orleans. Love love loved it. Many happy hour semi-party/gatherings were had and then some. I think because of the Column's close proximity to the university campuses and it being Uptown (evidently some of us couldn't be bothered to cross into/through the Quarter, yeah, I don't know) - it was easily accessible along the streetcar's path. One of my friends lived within walking distance of the Columns for a year and you bet your butt we were always finding an excuse to have a drink or two here. So the Columns Hotel is one of those charming New Orleans-esque boutique hotels. It's not very high occupancy, but it has that historical feel th..."},{"business_id":"rrNF0siUBVQOOgsFVfGpKA","review_id":"uZg17vrV47AsLIhLtlz_Zg","date":"2014-09-04T20:22:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9378507137298584,"text_excerpt":"This is one of my favorite spots in the city for happy hour or after dinner drinks. It has a great New Orleans vibe with a charming old world feel. One of the great things about the place is that you will see lots of different types of people in here, from hipsters, to college students, to business people who go after work, to formal-wear-wearing bridal parties. There are several places to have an intimate conversation (so good for a first date) or you can join the rowdy crowd in the main bar or, if you can get a seat, try the beautiful sprawling porch. It's also a hidden gem for Sunday brunch. They have a great menu and live jazz music, until 2 on Sunday I think. The food for brunch is u..."},{"business_id":"rrNF0siUBVQOOgsFVfGpKA","review_id":"gDwnepjg_31Rmgs-rfoiHA","date":"2012-04-16T20:02:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9364116191864014,"text_excerpt":"The Columns is definitely one of my top favorite bars to go to in New Orleans. It's very antiquated, which I like. I feel really classy going here even though you don't have to necessarily dress up. The drinks are a little higher than what I usually pay for drinks, but it's worth the money. They have one of the best bloody marys I've ever had. They also make delicious Cosmos. I also enjoy the music that they play here, which usually consists of classic rock. They have a pretty good happy hour. Sometimes we'll sit outside on the front porch and watch the street cars go by. It's an overall great atmosphere whether you're with group of friends, family, or on a date."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rrNF0siUBVQOOgsFVfGpKA","photo_id":"T04Vr5y0ydtuZnwZj7C-nw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/T04Vr5y0ydtuZnwZj7C-nw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9109117984771729},{"business_id":"rrNF0siUBVQOOgsFVfGpKA","photo_id":"dF1NwSFX6pERdbqh4YvWnw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dF1NwSFX6pERdbqh4YvWnw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8173771500587463},{"business_id":"rrNF0siUBVQOOgsFVfGpKA","photo_id":"vG8w0uMvGqX5JATPXpEyMg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/vG8w0uMvGqX5JATPXpEyMg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8120560050010681},{"business_id":"rrNF0siUBVQOOgsFVfGpKA","photo_id":"y9owIWEgmA-5dJaF5RSIZw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/y9owIWEgmA-5dJaF5RSIZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7895148396492004},{"business_id":"rrNF0siUBVQOOgsFVfGpKA","photo_id":"zsRzYVCWJMziDYP2QGK49w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zsRzYVCWJMziDYP2QGK49w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7711548209190369}]},"notebook_case":null}
